s://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105934#issuecomment-2959695236","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105934","id":2959695236,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6waV2E","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-10T15:22:14Z","updated_at":"2025-06-10T15:22:14Z","body":"> > * the other one for overriding speaker channels (which needs tweaking, as it cannot really reside in the project configs, as discussed in the last audio meeting)\r\n> \r\n> It has been with the most recent update. Overriding is not in project settings, its done with get/set methods on AudioServer.\r\n\r\nOhhh, I see. The settings I saw in the project were lingering options then. Sorry.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2959695236/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2960044516","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105934#issuecomment-2960044516","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105934","id":2960044516,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wbrHk","user":{"login":"BuzzLord","id":11238951,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjM4OTUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11238951?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord","html_url":"https://github.com/BuzzLord","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-10T17:17:00Z","updated_at":"2025-06-10T17:17:00Z","body":"Refactored this to only handle setting/overriding the `speaker_mode` of a project. \r\n\r\nChannel remapping will be moved to another PR.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2960044516/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3353681558","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105934#issuecomment-3353681558","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105934","id":3353681558,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7H5R6W","user":{"login":"BuzzLord","id":11238951,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjM4OTUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11238951?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord","html_url":"https://github.com/BuzzLord","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-30T20:24:30Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T20:24:30Z","body":"After today's discussion, it seems that we're leaning towards the idea that this PR probably only applies to developers troubleshooting engine issues, and not as a useful feature to be exposed in games. It was suggested that this could be done from the OS level, so I did some poking around to try it.\r\n\r\nI was able to use the [VB-Audio VB-CABLE driver](https://vb-audio.com/Cable/index.htm) to effectively do what this PR does. It should work for Windows and Mac. Linux almost certainly also has an equivalent feature.\r\n\r\nFor Windows:\r\n1. Install the VB-CABLE driver.\r\n2. In the **Sound** configuration window, under the _CABLE Output_ Recording device properties, enable _Listen to this device_, and set the playback device to the actual output device.\r\n3. Configure _CABLE Input_ to be an appropriate speaker configuration (e.g. 7.1 Surround).\r\n4. Set _CABLE Input_ to be the default playback device.\r\n\r\nThis results in the engine using 7.1 surround, and I confirmed the `AudioEffectCapture`/`AudioEffectRecord` bugs can be reproduced this way on a stereo audio device.\r\n\r\nWould it make more sense to just write some documentation describing how to configure these external methods rather than include this PR in the engine itself?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3353681558/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3583128115","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105934#issuecomment-3583128115","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105934","id":3583128115,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VkjIz","user":{"login":"fdemir","id":48316033,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MzE2MDMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48316033?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdemir","html_url":"https://github.com/fdemir","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdemir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdemir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdemir/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdemir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdemir/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdemir/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdemir/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdemir/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdemir/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-26T20:34:09Z","updated_at":"2025-11-26T20:34:09Z","body":"Bump! We need this!!!!","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3583128115/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3583187732","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105934#issuecomment-3583187732","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105934","id":3583187732,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VkxsU","user":{"login":"BuzzLord","id":11238951,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjM4OTUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11238951?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord","html_url":"https://github.com/BuzzLord","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-26T20:54:21Z","updated_at":"2025-11-26T20:54:21Z","body":"> Bump! We need this!!!!\r\n\r\nDo you mean the PR, or the proposed documentation in my last comment? We decided against merging the PR, due to its limited use as a debug tool, primarily for engine devs. If it is the PR you want, what exactly is it that you're hoping it can help with?\r\n\r\nIf its the docs you're waiting for, I've just been too busy/distracted recently to write anything detailed, but the instructions above are the core of what I envision, just with extra screenshots of the process.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3583187732/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3583223897","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105934#issuecomment-3583223897","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105934","id":3583223897,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Vk6hZ","user":{"login":"fdemir","id":48316033,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MzE2MDMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48316033?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdemir","html_url":"https://github.com/fdemir","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdemir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdemir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdemir/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdemir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdemir/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdemir/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdemir/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdemir/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fdemir/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-26T21:09:55Z","updated_at":"2025-11-26T21:09:55Z","body":"> > Bump! We need this!!!!\r\n> \r\n> Do you mean the PR, or the proposed documentation in my last comment? We decided against merging the PR, due to its limited use as a debug tool, primarily for engine devs. If it is the PR you want, what exactly is it that you're hoping it can help with?\r\n> \r\n> If its the docs you're waiting for, I've just been too busy/distracted recently to write anything detailed, but the instructions above are the core of what I envision, just with extra screenshots of the process.\r\n\r\nThanks for the quick reply. When we use voice record, we hear choppy sounds because my friend has 8-channel headphones that support surround sound (2 channels working fine for voice recording). It blocks the voice chat implementation.\r\n\r\nI thought that somehow gaining control over the channels would solve the problem. Maybe I commented on the wrong issue :/","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3583223897/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3583301040","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105934#issuecomment-3583301040","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105934","id":3583301040,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VlNWw","user":{"login":"BuzzLord","id":11238951,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjM4OTUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11238951?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord","html_url":"https://github.com/BuzzLord","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-26T21:43:45Z","updated_at":"2025-11-26T21:43:45Z","body":"> Thanks for the quick reply. When we use voice record, we hear choppy sounds because my friend has 8-channel headphones that support surround sound (2 channels working fine for voice recording). It blocks the voice chat implementation.\r\n> \r\n> I thought that somehow gaining control over the channels would solve the problem. Maybe I commented on the wrong issue :/\r\n\r\nAh yes, I have another PR (#92532) to fix that exact problem, and this PR was originally made to help test that one. \r\n\r\nTechnically this PR could be used to bypass the issue for surround sound systems by forcing them to stereo, but that's not a good solution to the issue. Since a software workaround can be used for testing (e.g. VB-Cable), instead of merging this PR, just documenting the process for devs to test different audio configs was what we decided on. And then of course fixing the actual underlying problem as well in #92532.\r\n\r\nI have been preoccupied recently, and haven't done everything I need to do for it, but maybe I'll get on that again.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3583301040/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3583400651","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105934#issuecomment-3583400651","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105934","id":3583400651,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VllrL","user":{"login":"BuzzLord","id":11238951,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjM4OTUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11238951?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord","html_url":"https://github.com/BuzzLord","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/gists{/gis